(7597124, 1226329, 87808, '<td valign="top">I really like this one, it is dramatic in a subtle way.  Instantly comes to mind is Fae size land. Love the meatiness of the mushroom and the almost hard looking bark of it''s stem. The green/yellows are spot on.  Even with that round dash of over blown sky the whiteness really adds to the scene.  How you got 35 points focus all across the photo is brilliant, it draws your eye. I am really enjoying looking at something so simple, but brilliant. Love this totally.</td>', 'I really like this one, it is dramatic in a subtle way.  Instantly comes to mind is Fae size land. Love the meatiness of the mushroom and the almost hard looking bark of it''s stem. The green/yellows are spot on.  Even with that round dash of over blown sky the whiteness really adds to the scene.  How you got 35 points focus all across the photo is brilliant, it draws your eye. I am really enjoying looking at something so simple, but brilliant. Love this totally.', '2018-09-20 14:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7597125, 1226389, 87808, '<td valign="top">Very very simple, but so dramatic and the colours are perfect for this.  Excellent shot!</td>', 'Very very simple, but so dramatic and the colours are perfect for this.  Excellent shot!', '2018-09-20 14:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
