(7597136, 1226396, 179769, '<td valign="top">This appears to be "looking from above".  A shame, because the image is pretty.</td>', 'This appears to be "looking from above".  A shame, because the image is pretty.', '2018-09-20 15:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7597442, 1226417, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Reflections in alternate realities or a view of the upside down. Love the above view of this candid moment of a man walking in what I believe is an exhibit hall. I also love how you captured the man''s position nearing the door as my eye spots the exit sign towards the lower right corner. Because of that added element it makes me think he walks solo in the sparse empty space but is about to find an exit to maybe connect with others or find a ''fulfilling space'' full of life and color.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Reflections in alternate realities or a view of the upside down. Love the above view of this candid moment of a man walking in what I believe is an exhibit hall. I also love how you captured the man''s position nearing the door as my eye spots the exit sign towards the lower right corner. Because of that added element it makes me think he walks solo in the sparse empty space but is about to find an exit to maybe connect with others or find a ''fulfilling space'' full of life and color.', '2018-09-23 16:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7597443, 1226329, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love this low to the ground view, where one does feel tiny like an ant looking up at the majestic world of mushroom, moss, trees and leaves. Akin to Journey to the Center of the Earth where mushrooms were as massively tall as trees. Great perspective and love the details I can see under the mushroom!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love this low to the ground view, where one does feel tiny like an ant looking up at the majestic world of mushroom, moss, trees and leaves. Akin to Journey to the Center of the Earth where mushrooms were as massively tall as trees. Great perspective and love the details I can see under the mushroom!', '2018-09-23 16:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7597447, 1226401, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Awesome idea! Love the Monarch captured in mid-flight ''fluttering'' from one flower and off to the next! I can see another Monarch''s wing as it rests on another flower. Hmmm, if I had to guess how you accomplished this unique view it would be from under a glass tabletop looking up. Getting back to the photo - this is a wonderful cheerful image with rich colors and great details showing us a view one does not normally get to see! Great job!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Awesome idea! Love the Monarch captured in mid-flight ''fluttering'' from one flower and off to the next! I can see another Monarch''s wing as it rests on another flower. Hmmm, if I had to guess how you accomplished this unique view it would be from under a glass tabletop looking up. Getting back to the photo - this is a wonderful cheerful image with rich colors and great details showing us a view one does not normally get to see! Great job!', '2018-09-23 19:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7597451, 1226291, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love the title given that the perspective now has the mailbox among the clouds! Great details and the angle really makes me feel that I am shrunk down and looking up at this skyscraper of a mailbox.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love the title given that the perspective now has the mailbox among the clouds! Great details and the angle really makes me feel that I am shrunk down and looking up at this skyscraper of a mailbox.', '2018-09-23 22:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7597453, 1226270, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Wonderful close-up shot of the underside of this airplane flying through the clouds. I like that this shot is not static but dynamic in the capture of action. There is a ''sense'' of movement as that we are catching sight of the G-BHXS as it moves in the frame and is about the exit out of frame in the top right corner. Love the two contrails of airplanes in the background above and behind the wing for it adds to the visual interest of the shot</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Wonderful close-up shot of the underside of this airplane flying through the clouds. I like that this shot is not static but dynamic in the capture of action. There is a ''sense'' of movement as that we are catching sight of the G-BHXS as it moves in the frame and is about the exit out of frame in the top right corner. Love the two contrails of airplanes in the background above and behind the wing for it adds to the visual interest of the shot', '2018-09-23 22:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
