(7597614, 1226164, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>A unique view of under a bird as it spreads it wings ready to take flight from the tree branch! Love how the light illuminates the feathers of the bird. Not too sure about the sepia treatment for I wonder if there would be better contrasting detail between the wings and the sky if this was set to B&amp;W. Nonetheless, great detail and excellent capture from a different angle showing the moment of about to take flight.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. A unique view of under a bird as it spreads it wings ready to take flight from the tree branch! Love how the light illuminates the feathers of the bird. Not too sure about the sepia treatment for I wonder if there would be better contrasting detail between the wings and the sky if this was set to B&W. Nonetheless, great detail and excellent capture from a different angle showing the moment of about to take flight.', '2018-09-25 14:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7597620, 1226401, 806, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful scene captured from a perspective that doesn''t feel forced and makes me feel that I''m viewing it through my own eyes and not someone else''s or a lens. Nice colors. Nicely done.</td>', 'This is a beautiful scene captured from a perspective that doesn''t feel forced and makes me feel that I''m viewing it through my own eyes and not someone else''s or a lens. Nice colors. Nicely done.', '2018-09-25 17:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
