(7597623, 1226375, 806, '<td valign="top">first of all...what a cutie pie! the photo captures the viewer with uncertainty, story and mystery. doesn''t even need a title. the photo says it all. well done!</td>', 'first of all...what a cutie pie! the photo captures the viewer with uncertainty, story and mystery. doesn''t even need a title. the photo says it all. well done!', '2018-09-25 17:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
