(7597625, 1226432, 806, '<td valign="top">i like this alot. great color to capture the eye and make it dance around the image. diagonal lines i guess would have been cliche yet i''m still yearning for them. very cool image non the less.</td>', 'i like this alot. great color to capture the eye and make it dance around the image. diagonal lines i guess would have been cliche yet i''m still yearning for them. very cool image non the less.', '2018-09-25 17:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
