(7597627, 1226329, 806, '<td valign="top">the mushroom and the texture of the wood make for a great image. I think the cropping could be scaled down or else there''s too much going on. seems over sharpened?</td>', 'the mushroom and the texture of the wood make for a great image. I think the cropping could be scaled down or else there''s too much going on. seems over sharpened?', '2018-09-25 17:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
