(7597693, 1226281, 17203, '<td valign="top">Wow, 13 years, and your last ribbon was a photo of stars, too. Obviously you should get outside more often. I''m impressed that you dared to venture into Pixinsight''s deep, muddy waters.<br/> <br/>Here''s a little trick you might find useful... in Photoshop, select Color Range &gt; Highlights with a pretty big fuzziness value to catch most of the stars. Select &gt; Modify &gt; Expand by 4 or 5 pixels, then hide the selection. Choose Filter &gt; Other &gt; Minimum with a radius of about 0.4 pixels (preserve roundness), and see if that helps.</td>', 'Wow, 13 years, and your last ribbon was a photo of stars, too. Obviously you should get outside more often. I''m impressed that you dared to venture into Pixinsight''s deep, muddy waters. Here''s a little trick you might find useful... in Photoshop, select Color Range > Highlights with a pretty big fuzziness value to catch most of the stars. Select > Modify > Expand by 4 or 5 pixels, then hide the selection. Choose Filter > Other > Minimum with a radius of about 0.4 pixels (preserve roundness), and see if that helps.', '2018-09-26 11:55:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(7597694, 1226401, 17203, '<td valign="top">Sometimes you capture a shot for a challenge that you know just isn''t fair. This is one of those times.</td>', 'Sometimes you capture a shot for a challenge that you know just isn''t fair. This is one of those times.', '2018-09-26 11:57:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(7597695, 1226375, 17203, '<td valign="top">Wow, you really put in a lot of effort on the setup for a virtual ribbon. Congrats!</td>', 'Wow, you really put in a lot of effort on the setup for a virtual ribbon. Congrats!', '2018-09-26 12:00:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(7597696, 1226401, 12611, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful- stunning realism but with all the wonder of a Children''s book illustration. Congrats on the Blue!</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful- stunning realism but with all the wonder of a Children''s book illustration. Congrats on the Blue!', '2018-09-26 12:11:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(7597697, 1226428, 12611, '<td valign="top">This is really well put together, from the overall color profile, to the background/overly texture- really well done and underrated.</td>', 'This is really well put together, from the overall color profile, to the background/overly texture- really well done and underrated.', '2018-09-26 12:15:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(7597698, 1226375, 58482, '<td valign="top">Yes nice job I have another suggestion dig a whole put a mirror at the bottom and then snap from an inconspicuous spot next to the dog</td>', 'Yes nice job I have another suggestion dig a whole put a mirror at the bottom and then snap from an inconspicuous spot next to the dog', '2018-09-26 12:45:07.000000', NULL, 0),
